# CARBON · build-Mac settings for deploy.sh
# Copy to ios/.env.local ON THE BUILD MAC and fill in. .env.local is gitignored. Never commit it.
# The bundle ID comes from ios/Config/Local.xcconfig, not from here.

# Your iPhone's UDID.
# Find it with: xcrun xctrace list devices
# It's the long ID in the last parentheses on the iPhone's line.
CARBON_UDID=""
